 "description": "<p>An anime-queen take on costume lingerie: a full patent leather jumpsuit in black, fronted by a zipper that runs the length of the outfit. The shine is the design - patent leather under party light does what printed fabric cannot.</p>\n<p>The cut is one-piece with a fitted line through the torso, sized 90-155 lbs in a single size. The zipper is functional rather than decorative, which changes how the costume is worn: closed for the entrance, and however you like after.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: patent leather</li>\n<li>Item type: jumpsuit</li>\n<li>Style: anime queen, full front zipper</li>\n<li>Color: black</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, 90-155 lbs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Wipe-clean surface, no ironing questions. Fits 90-155 lbs with stretch through the shoulders.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Black patent leather anime queen jumpsuit with full front zipper, one size for 90-155 lbs.</p>\n",
